e old conditions did not: explicit fail-closed behaviour and tests for a basis that names no known settlement, and for a basis already spent by a resolved earlier transfer, which today I only cover through the disputed path. Re-run the gates and every mutation at the new exact head, including the multi-reference mutation that survived my first pass, and hunt for more. Then a fresh artifact resting on this promise and a fresh review request resting only on that artifact."}